1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,780
A grid of cards, all face down...

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:06,680
but two of them are secretly a match!

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,800
This is Equation Match!

4
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:14,440
Flip two cards — find the equation and its answer!

5
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:16,520
Flip this one...

6
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,320
three plus four...

7
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:20,580
Flip this one...

8
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:24,740
seven — that's the match, they disappear!

9
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:30,620
Every pair is somewhere on the board — remember where you've looked!

10
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:36,460
Parents — this builds memory and quick mental math, together!

11
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:45,700
Tap Math Game Zone, flip into Equation Match, pick your level, and find every pair!

12
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:51,440
Abacus Kids — free to flip, on the App Store and Google Play!
